or nethack-gnome or nethack-qt)

Done.

<3 Debian Linux. Probably works for distros based on debian, like
Mepis or Ubuntu as well.
------------

Compiling nethack (on debian linux)?

apt-get source nethack # gets the source
apt-get build-dep nethack # installs libraries needed
cd nethack(version-number like 3.4.3)
# apply patches now, manually or with patch/diff
dpkg-buildpackage -rfakeroot -b #compiles nethack to Debian rules
cd ..
su
#type in password here
dpkg -i nethack-common_3.4.3-6_i386.deb
nethack-console_3.4.3-6_i386.deb

etc. etc. for whatever packages you need (x11, qt, gnome).

